infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title Origin shield collapses the herd
  desc One cold URL: 200 edge misses funnel into a single origin request
  sequences
    - label 200 edge POPs miss the same URL
      desc Cold URL: every regional POP misses simultaneously
    - label 200 misses forward to one shield node
      desc All POPs in the region funnel through the regional shield
    - label Shield holds 1 outstanding origin fetch
      desc The other 199 requests queue behind it
    - label Origin sees 1 request, not 200
      desc Shield fans the response back to all 199 waiting edges
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b
